<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Halvorsen 2027</a></li><li>Volunteer desk</li></ol><p class="kick">Volunteer desk</p><h1>{% if in_vo %}Thanks for coming out, {{ CurrentUser.FirstName }}.{% else %}Volunteer desk{% endif %}</h1><p class="lede">{% if in_vo %}Your next shifts, the turf map shaded by doors knocked, and this week’s briefs. Demo account; names and numbers are fictional.{% else %}Shifts, turf and the door script, for signed-in volunteers.{% endif %}</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w">{% if in_vo %}<div class="badge"><span class="hole"></span><div><div class="t">HALVORSEN 2027 · VOLUNTEER</div><div class="who">{{ CurrentUser.FirstName }} {{ CurrentUser.LastName }}</div><div class="bc">DEMO ACCOUNT · FIELD ORGANIZER: RUTH OKONJO (555) 016-2031</div></div></div><div class="dg"><div><h2>Shift board</h2>{%- assign shl = get_content_items(ContentType="shifts", OrderBy="date asc", PageSize=20) -%}{%- assign c = 0 -%}{% for p in shl.Items %}{%- capture sx_d -%}{{ p.PublishedContent.date }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign sx = sx_d | remove: "-" | plus: 0 -%}{% if sx >= todayn and c < 5 %}{%- assign c = c | plus: 1 -%}{%- assign y=p.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture sdn_d -%}{{ y.date }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign sdn = sdn_d | remove: "-" | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _nsl -%}{{ y.slots }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign sl = _nsl | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _nfl -%}{{ y.filled }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign fl = _nfl | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign open = sl | minus: fl -%}{%- assign fp = fl | times: 100 | divided_by: sl -%}<a class="shift" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ p.RoutePath }}"><span class="dblk"><b>{{ sdn_d | date: "%b" }}</b><i>{{ sdn_d | date: "%-d" }}</i><small>{{ sdn_d | date: "%a" }}</small></span><span>{% if sdn == todayn %}<span class="chip today">Today</span> {% endif %}<b>{{ p.PrimaryField }}</b><small>{{ y.time_label }} · {{ y.meet }} · lead {{ y.lead }}</small><small>{{ y.turf }}</small></span><span class="fill"><div class="bar{% if open > 3 %} brick{% endif %}"><i style="width:{{ fp }}%"></i></div><small>{% if open > 0 %}{{ open }} of {{ sl }} spots open{% else %}Full{% endif %}</small></span></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}<p><a href="{{ PathBase }}/shifts">All shifts &rarr;</a></p><h2 style="margin-top:36px">Turf map: doors knocked</h2><svg class="dmap" viewBox="0 0 1200 740" role="img" aria-label="District 2 precinct map, drawn from precinct content"><rect width="1200" height="740" fill="#eef0e4"/><path d="M-10,300 C120,320 210,410 330,430 C450,450 520,380 640,420 C760,460 820,560 960,560 C1060,560 1120,520 1210,540" fill="none" stroke="#9fbfc9" stroke-width="26" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M-10,300 C120,320 210,410 330,430 C450,450 520,380 640,420 C760,460 820,560 960,560 C1060,560 1120,520 1210,540" fill="none" stroke="#bcd6dd" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"/><ellipse cx="1050" cy="600" rx="70" ry="38" fill="#bcd6dd" stroke="#9fbfc9" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M80,690 L1180,80" stroke="#c9b98e" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M60,200 C300,240 700,230 1180,250" stroke="#c9b98e" stroke-width="4" fill="none"/>{%- assign pmap = get_content_items(ContentType="precincts", OrderBy="sort_order asc", PageSize=20) -%}{% for pm in pmap.Items %}{%- assign mz=pm.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture _nmno -%}{{ mz.number }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign mno = _nmno | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _npg -%}{{ mz.doors_goal }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign pg = _npg | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _npd -%}{{ mz.doors_done }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign pd = _npd | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign pct = pd | times: 100 | divided_by: pg -%}{%- assign op = pct | times: 0.0085 | plus: 0.1 -%}<a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ pm.RoutePath }}"><path class="pz" d="{{ mz.patch }}" fill="#1f4d3b" fill-opacity="{{ op }}" stroke="#1d2321" stroke-width="2.5"/></a>{% endfor %}<path d="M-10,300 C120,320 210,410 330,430 C450,450 520,380 640,420 C760,460 820,560 960,560 C1060,560 1120,520 1210,540" fill="none" stroke="#9fbfc9" stroke-opacity=".75" stroke-width="16" stroke-linecap="round" pointer-events="none"/><ellipse cx="1050" cy="600" rx="62" ry="32" fill="#bcd6dd" fill-opacity=".85" pointer-events="none"/>{% for pm in pmap.Items %}{%- assign mz=pm.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture _npg2 -%}{{ mz.doors_goal }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign pg2 = _npg2 | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _nly -%}{{ mz.label_y }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign ly = _nly | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _npd2 -%}{{ mz.doors_done }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign pd2 = _npd2 | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign pct = pd2 | times: 100 | divided_by: pg2 -%}<text x="{{ mz.label_x }}" y="{{ mz.label_y }}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="30" font-weight="800" fill="{% if pct >= 50 %}#fff{% else %}#1d2321{% endif %}" pointer-events="none">{{ pct }}%</text><text x="{{ mz.label_x }}" y="{{ ly | plus: 26 }}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="{% if pct >= 50 %}#fff{% else %}#1d2321{% endif %}" pointer-events="none">{{ pm.PrimaryField }}</text>{% endfor %}<text x="1180" y="728" text-anchor="end" font-size="14" fill="#4a524e" font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace">WREN RIVER · DISTRICT 2 · NOT TO SCALE</text></svg><p class="muted" style="font-size:.9rem">Darker green means more of the precinct’s door goal is done, worked out on the server from each precinct’s counts.</p></div><aside>{%- assign br = get_content_items(ContentType="notes", Filter="audience eq 'volunteers'", OrderBy="sort_order asc", PageSize=5) -%}<div class="card side"><p class="kick">This week’s briefs</p>{% for p in br.Items %}<a class="hit" style="padding:12px 0" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ p.RoutePath }}"><b style="font-size:1rem">{{ p.PrimaryField }}</b><p>{{ p.PublishedContent.summary }}</p></a>{% endfor %}</div><div class="card side" style="margin-top:16px"><p class="kick">At every door</p><ol style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-size:.95rem"><li>Your name, and that you are a neighbor.</li><li>One line on the precinct issue from your turf sheet.</li><li>Ask one question. Listen. Write down what they said.</li><li>Leave a plan card, even if nobody answers.</li></ol></div></aside></div>{% else %}<div class="lockp"><p class="kick" style="color:var(--brick)">🔒 Volunteer desk</p><h2>Sign in to see your shifts and turf.</h2><p class="muted">This page is checked on the server: signed out, its contents are never sent to the browser. In the story, the field organizer opens a volunteer account after your first shift, and the campaign manager opens staff accounts.</p><p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/account/login?returnUrl=/volunteers">Sign in</a><a class="btn line" href="{{ PathBase }}/help">How to help</a></p></div>{% endif %}</div></section>
